# Factory

- Before a technical-requirements file exists: only `@init-langchain` / `@init-agent` / discovery. No `make_graph` implementation.
- After the spec is approved: implement the ticket. Do not send the user to write the agent themselves.
- Implement only the chosen language (`TRACK.md`).
- `make_graph` / `makeGraph` stays the Harbor entry.
